                        <figcaption>
                          <span style="border-top-color: #eee; border-left-color: #eee;">10/15 - The Broadway-Spring Arcade Building (1924)</span> <span style="border-top-color: #ddd; border-left-color: #ddd;"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera" title=", Photo by:"></i> Tim Paik</span>
                        </figcaption>
